---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Is Poland Safe Now?"
  description="About Is Poland Safe Now?, the independent service answering 'is Poland safe to visit right now?' with an hourly-updated security status for each of the 16 Polish voivodeships."
  path="/about"
>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto flex max-w-3xl flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100">About</h1>
    <p>
      Is Poland Safe Now? is an independent information service that summarizes publicly reported developments
      relevant to Poland's regional security situation — including the Russia-Ukraine war, Belarus border activity,
      Kaliningrad, airspace violations, drone or missile incidents, RCB warnings, and border, airport, or transport
      disruptions — organized by voivodeship.
    </p>
    <p>
      It is not affiliated with the Polish government, RCB, or any emergency service, and it is not an official
      warning system. It cannot guarantee safety. Always follow instructions from Polish authorities. For
      emergencies, call 112.
    </p>
    <p>
      Regional statuses are refreshed every hour from recent news coverage — see the
      <a class="underline" href="/methodology">methodology page</a> for how that works and its current limits.
    </p>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
</BaseLayout>
